              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "E-ting"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Perfect for January 1st. It’s part of the New Year tradition around here. Will be served with cornmeal muffins and green vegetables. \n\nI added some garlic powder &amp; cayenne pepper to nip it up a notch.",
            "datePublished": "2019-12-31T22:06:12.260Z"
